comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-25T17:56:48.617Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: all-status keyword searches for test-audit returned no items; exact test audit returned seven historical broader audits and agent skills located canonical parent pm-z3ez. This request adds reusable guidance and does not claim those completed audits as outstanding."
  "2026-09-25T17:59:30.446Z","harness:codex","Adapted upstream skill and campaign at e0d80000067d224e93af6107ed093a21e046879f, preserving MIT copyright. Added four-question authoring gate, contract/keeper evidence ledger, SDK versus transport ownership, public sdk/testing retention, isolated pre-fix controls, and prohibition on coverage denominator/gate weakening. Linked from developer workflow and skill index. Validation: pnpm build and docs-skills gate passed; explicit new-skill frontmatter, relative links, and reference reachability passed after correcting tracker path. This is guidance adaptation, not execution of a repository test-deletion campaign or a claim of fresh full-suite coverage."
  "2026-09-25T18:15:48.126Z","harness:codex","PR 1310 first-head CI passed. CodeRabbit identified that pre-fix direct stateful CLI commands need explicit temporary PM_PATH and PM_GLOBAL_PATH even inside a worktree. Clarified both the entrypoint and campaign reference, while distinguishing intentional repository tracking from test mutations. Build and isolated linked docs-skills test passed again. The embedded SkillSpector cross-skill-access warning is not applicable to these public repository guidance links; no secret or private skill enumeration occurs."
